WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.586 --> 00:00:03.926 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
지금은 오히려 베니스 작업을 하면서는

2
00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:06.006 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
언어와 내러티브

3
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:08.766 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그리고 언어적이지 않은 것

4
00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:11.526 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
혹은 매체성을 중요하게 생각하는

5
00:00:11.526 --> 00:00:12.846 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
조각 같은 경우는

6
00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.896 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
저는 그런 편의 작업을 하지만

7
00:00:14.896 --> 00:00:18.286 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그 작업 자체가 중요한 작업과

8
00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:21.846 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
어떠한 이야기를 하기 위해서

9
00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:23.766 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
매개가 되는 작업

10
00:00:23.766 --> 00:00:26.406 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
이런 구도로 보는 것 같기도 해요.

11
00:00:26.446 --> 00:00:29.246 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
왜냐하면 비엔날레는 특히 가면

12
00:00:29.246 --> 00:00:32.126 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
정치·사회적인 이슈가 너무나 많기 때문에

13
00:00:32.126 --> 00:00:34.306 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
그 안에서 조각의 언어가

14
00:00:34.306 --> 00:00:37.006 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
어떻게 존재할 수 있는지

15
00:00:37.006 --> 00:00:38.906 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
이런 구도를 더 많이

16
00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:41.206 line:83.4%,start position:50% size:94% align:center
보게 되는 것 같아요.
